        heading: 'Make the Plan Impossible to Ignore',
        body: 'The reason most study schedules fail isn\'t planning — it\'s that nothing enforces them. A calendar can\'t stop you opening TikTok. This is where Masterly differs from a plain planner: its distracting apps lock up to three times a day, and you unlock them only by passing a short quiz generated from your own notes or PDFs, through iOS Screen Time. The schedule stops being a suggestion and becomes a gate. You wanted to check your phone anyway, so you answer a few questions on today\'s topic first — which doubles as retrieval practice, one of the most effective ways to actually remember material. Each completed quiz is tracked, so your daily progress and streak build visibly. For students who lose whole evenings to their phone, tying the schedule to the block is the part that makes it stick.',
