        heading: 'Your Three Options After a Missed Day',
        body: 'One: restart from day 1. It\'s the official path, and if the all-or-nothing stakes are what got you to day 30 in the first place, it may be the right one. Two: add the day back. Wake up tomorrow, do the day you missed, and finish on day 76 instead of day 75. You still complete 75 full days — you just refuse to let one gap delete the other 74. Three: switch to a structure with recovery built in, like 75 Soft or a custom challenge that matches the life you actually have. Only the first option is "75 Hard" by the official definition, and that\'s fine to say out loud. The version of the challenge you finish beats the version you restart four times and abandon in March.',
